/-!
# The exceptional chief-section model comparison

The literal conjugation action descends through K/O₂(K) on every chief
section. Survival of the marked generalized-Fitting lift produces a normal
C-component image and preserves its exact F* image. Every C-component in
the actual G.6.4 models is simple with a small model order. The large-prime
PSL₂ branch has a different order; in the odd-by-SL₂ branch every simple
image kills F*. These two obstructions exclude all G.6.4 alternatives.

The chief-section joint-detection extension constructs a section on which
both the marked lift and a seed element survive, and applies this exclusion
to complete the odd-pair contradiction in 11.5.8, printed p.784.
-/
